# =============================================================================
# DATA KAMUS BAHASA BUGIS — BATCH 5: 100 ENTRI (nomor 301–400)
# Domain: Lingkungan Sosial | Emosi Lanjutan | Verba Sehari-hari Lanjutan |
#         Rumah & Perabot Tradisional | Bilangan & Ukuran Lanjutan
# Semantic Web Course — Proyek Akhir
# Encoding: UTF-8
# Sumber: OJED (sealang.net/ojed), Wiktionary Bugis,
#         Matthes (1874) Boegineesch-Hollandsch Woordenboek
# Aksara Lontaraq: Unicode Block Buginese U+1A00–U+1A1F
#   Verifikasi: r12a.github.io/scripts/bugi/bug.html (27-Apr-2026)
#   Konsonan (18): ᨀka ᨁga ᨂng ᨄpa ᨅba ᨆma ᨈta ᨉda ᨊna ᨌca ᨍja
#                  ᨎnya ᨐya ᨑra ᨒla ᨓwa ᨔsa ᨖha | ᨕ vowel-carrier
#   Vokal: ᨗi ᨘu ᨙe(prebase) ᨚo ᨛə
#   Catatan: konsonan akhir suku kata (coda) TIDAK ditulis dalam Lontaraq
# Tidak ada duplikat dari batch 1–4 (entri 1–300)
# =============================================================================

@prefix bugis:  <http://example.org/bugis#> .
@prefix rdf:    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:    <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


